# Hypothesis: process cells in row-major order. Cell moves right iff the cell immediately right (in currently-built-out grid, after previous moves) is background.
# Source: if moved, set out[r][c]=bg (delete). Otherwise out[r][c]=inval.
def f(gi):
    h,w=len(gi),len(gi[0])
    bg=Ct(v for row in gi for v in row).most_common(1)[0][0]
    out=[[bg]*w for _ in range(h)]
